    "text": "peakofohio.com\nwebsite\nWest Liberty\nLocal boys’ golf teams take on OHSAA sectionals\nBy Nate Bope,\n18 hours agoWest Liberty-Salem closed out a successful season at sectionals, finishing 9th. The Tigers were just eight strokes shy of a top-five spot. They ended the year with an 11-7 record and 5th place in the OHC. Sutton Wilcoxon earned 2nd Team All-OHC honors, while Troy Christison and Braydon Thompson received...",
